<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At a time when
we don't have adequate troops...</font>

106
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:36,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and at a time when everybody else
is going all out to do their job you...</font>

