<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi!</font>

130
00:06:57,890 --> 00:07:01,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well I picked these guys up
on my way back from my mission.</font>

