134
00:07:13,030 --> 00:07:14,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though it's only a tiny clue</font>

135
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:17,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">now there's finally something
that links to Orochimaru!</font>

136
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:21,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait for me, Shizune!</font>

137
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:23,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm coming to your rescue!</font>

138
00:07:26,050 --> 00:07:29,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...
Where is he going in such a hurry?</font>

139
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:37,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fuujin, Raijin...
It's about time to head out!</font>

140
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— All right.
— All right!</font>

141
00:07:44,860 --> 00:07:46,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-Mizuki...</font>

142
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna find him without fail!</font>

143
00:07:55,030 --> 00:07:55,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

144
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:12,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see... Tsubaki.</font>

145
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:16,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That woman captain was
pretty tenacious, wasn't she?</font>

146
00:08:16,550 --> 00:08:19,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to her I'm starving,
Elder Brother.</font>

147
00:08:20,770 --> 00:08:22,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stop laughing!</font>

148
00:08:22,350 --> 00:08:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it stopped.</font>

149
00:08:30,650 --> 00:08:32,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in the Leaves...</font>

150
00:08:33,650 --> 00:08:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haven't seen this vista
for quite a while.</font>

151
00:08:35,450 --> 00:08:36,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes...</font>

152
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:41,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother, this rice is hard!</font>

153
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot! It's one and the same once
it's inside your stomach!</font>

154
00:08:44,330 --> 00:08:46,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... you're awesome, Elder Brother.</font>

155
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:48,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?
It's gotten all raggedy.</font>

156
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:51,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You need to buy a new one.</font>

157
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

158
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:55,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter, Tsubaki?</font>

159
00:08:56,010 --> 00:08:58,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I noticed some Black Ops
in the mountains earlier.</font>

160
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:01,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In a secluded place
in the mountains like this!</font>

161
00:09:07,690 --> 00:09:08,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

162
00:09:12,610 --> 00:09:15,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't tell me anything, will you?</font>

163
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:23,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To you the Leaf Village looks just
like it did before doesn't it, Mizuki?</font>

164
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:25,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

165
00:09:26,830 --> 00:09:31,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A lot of people died while
you were away, Mizuki.</font>

166
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:35,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This rice soup is great
huh, Elder Brother?</font>

167
00:09:35,170 --> 00:09:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... Very different from the institution.</font>

168
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:40,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you leaving again?</font>

169
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

170
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:44,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

171
00:09:45,490 --> 00:09:50,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please Mizuki! Please end
your involvement with Orochimaru!</font>

172
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:57,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of Orochimaru
many people died!</font>

173
00:09:58,630 --> 00:10:02,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of Orochimaru
the Leaf Village was in shambles!</font>

174
00:10:03,550 --> 00:10:04,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even the Third Hokage was...</font>

175
00:10:06,550 --> 00:10:10,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only if you hadn't gotten involved
with Orochimaru, Mizuki,</font>

176
00:10:10,430 --> 00:10:12,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you and I would now...</font>

177
00:10:17,770 --> 00:10:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything will be fine, Tsubaki.</font>

178
00:10:20,650 --> 00:10:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time I won't make the mistake</font>

179
00:10:23,030 --> 00:10:25,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of having that Nine-Tailed brat
get in my way.</font>

180
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then...</font>

181
00:10:26,650 --> 00:10:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy fought for the Leaf
when Orochimaru attacked!</font>

182
00:10:33,540 --> 00:10:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Nine-Tailed brat did...?</font>

183
00:10:36,910 --> 00:10:38,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That brat did...?!</font>

184
00:10:42,130 --> 00:10:46,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right. He's not some scary kid
like you said he was!</font>

185
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So please stop with
your foolish ideas!</font>

186
00:10:50,140 --> 00:10:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's already over!
It's all already over! So...</font>

187
00:10:59,650 --> 00:11:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... It's not over yet!</font>

188
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:07,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that Nine-Tailed brat is
acting the hero, huh?</font>

189
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:08,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't make me laugh!</font>

190
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:13,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Half-wits as always, huh!
Those Leaf guys!</font>

191
00:11:14,580 --> 00:11:15,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...?!</font>

192
00:11:15,490 --> 00:11:16,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come!</font>

193
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will get my hands on
Orochimaru's ultimate power!</font>

194
00:11:21,710 --> 00:11:24,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And will teach this village
a lesson!</font>

195
00:11:25,170 --> 00:11:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Power...
Orochimaru's ultimate power!</font>

196
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:36,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I do that...
You and I will have everything go our way!</font>

197
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:41,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

198
00:11:43,810 --> 00:11:44,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki!</font>

199
00:11:45,770 --> 00:11:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please...</font>

200
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Become the kind and gentle Mizuki
again just like before.</font>

201
00:11:50,900 --> 00:11:53,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you really love me...</font>

202
00:11:54,700 --> 00:11:56,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">don't do anything stupid!</font>

203
00:11:58,750 --> 00:11:59,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsubaki...</font>

204
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right then...</font>

205
00:12:13,390 --> 00:12:15,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then,
I'll leave the rest in your hands.</font>

206
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not so quickly!</font>

207
00:12:18,310 --> 00:12:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you are! Next for you
is an S-rank mission!</font>

208
00:12:21,390 --> 00:12:23,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a real slave driver.</font>

209
00:12:26,860 --> 00:12:27,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Iruka Team...</font>

210
00:12:28,060 --> 00:12:30,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">has completed rounding up
the inmates.</font>

211
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:33,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Kakashi-sensei!
I beg your pardon!</font>

212
00:12:33,190 --> 00:12:35,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry about it.
Good work.</font>

213
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:40,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like neither of us are going
to get a chance to rest, Iruka-sensei.</font>

214
00:12:43,700 --> 00:12:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Art of Summoning!</font>

215
00:12:48,580 --> 00:12:50,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, youngster...</font>

216
00:12:50,830 --> 00:12:53,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well Iruka-sensei,
I'll leave the rest to you.</font>

217
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:55,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Huh?</font>

218
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:59,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka, you have a mission.
Time is of the essence.</font>

219
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes ma'am?</font>

220
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:09,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry.
We've taken more time than anticipated.</font>

221
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:16,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki...</font>

222
00:13:19,860 --> 00:13:21,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it, Tonton?</font>

223
00:13:23,820 --> 00:13:24,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here he comes!</font>

224
00:13:27,450 --> 00:13:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait, Naruto!</font>

225
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei?!</font>

226
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:31,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tonton?!</font>

227
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is what I smelled...</font>

228
00:13:39,050 --> 00:13:40,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for your hard work, Tonton.</font>

229
00:13:41,180 --> 00:13:43,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll look out for these two
from here onward</font>

230
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so you go back to the village.</font>

231
00:13:50,810 --> 00:13:54,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother Mizuki...
Shouldn't we be hurrying?</font>

232
00:13:54,110 --> 00:13:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-To Orochimaru's?</font>

233
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Nine-Tailed brat...</font>

234
00:14:05,830 --> 00:14:08,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you dare touch Iruka-sensei!</font>

235
00:14:09,290 --> 00:14:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Otherwise I'll kill you!</font>

236
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:17,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— In that case I'll go for it!
— In that case I'll go for it!</font>

237
00:14:26,930 --> 00:14:28,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I may have done
a little too much!</font>

238
00:14:30,850 --> 00:14:32,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me that...</font>

239
00:14:32,980 --> 00:14:35,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that failure of a Nine-Tailed brat is...</font>

240
00:14:36,690 --> 00:14:39,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother...
Do Nine-Tails taste good?</font>

241
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:41,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... I'm sure they're good.</font>

242
00:14:43,370 --> 00:14:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei, you didn't come here
just to drag me home?</font>

243
00:14:47,580 --> 00:14:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well you're not the kind of guy
who would go back calmly</font>

244
00:14:49,750 --> 00:14:51,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I simply said
"Come back", are you!</font>

245
00:14:51,620 --> 00:14:55,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are right, Iruka-sensei!
You really know me don't you!</font>

246
00:14:56,090 --> 00:14:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get carried away like that!</font>

247
00:14:58,170 --> 00:15:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you let your guard down
you'll get your fingers burned!</font>

248
00:15:02,250 --> 00:15:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Did you find something?</font>

249
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:08,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... It's a bad inmate's smell!</font>

250
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:17,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then what in the world
can I do with these now?</font>

251
00:15:20,990 --> 00:15:23,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It smells like
we're getting pretty close now.</font>

252
00:15:29,410 --> 00:15:30,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune?!</font>

253
00:15:31,450 --> 00:15:32,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Are you all right?</font>

254
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto?!</font>

255
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prisoner's garb is scattered
about here and there.</font>

256
00:15:39,290 --> 00:15:43,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like somebody's trying
to buy time by deceiving my nose...</font>

257
00:15:43,630 --> 00:15:45,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki was just one step away</font>

258
00:15:45,300 --> 00:15:47,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we ended up
letting them get away.</font>

259
00:15:47,090 --> 00:15:49,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'm so glad you're safe.</font>

260
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:50,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

261
00:15:50,390 --> 00:15:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My comrades are pursing Mizuki.
Let's hurry!</font>

262
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

263
00:15:55,180 --> 00:15:56,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This smells!</font>

264
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a strong smell
of prisoners wafting.</font>

265
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Mizuki and the others!
There's no mistake!</font>

266
00:16:02,650 --> 00:16:05,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! We're almost there!</font>

267
00:16:05,650 --> 00:16:08,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... if we enter the basin
just like this</font>

268
00:16:08,110 --> 00:16:10,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will make it easy for
the enemy to attack from the plateau.</font>

269
00:16:11,110 --> 00:16:12,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would be safer to make a detour</font>

270
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and make our way up
to the top of a hill.</font>

271
00:16:14,190 --> 00:16:15,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?!</font>

272
00:16:15,810 --> 00:16:19,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have a really good open view
so we'll be fine!</font>

273
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:22,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... Those guys are trying to buy time.</font>

274
00:16:23,150 --> 00:16:25,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we make a detour we may not
be able to catch up with them!</font>

275
00:16:31,290 --> 00:16:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

276
00:16:32,660 --> 00:16:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could I have fallen
for such a trap?!</font>

277
00:16:35,500 --> 00:16:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful, Naruto!</font>

278
00:16:37,170 --> 00:16:39,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time it's not a dummy.
A real entity is lurking there!</font>

279
00:16:40,630 --> 00:16:41,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A rock?!</font>

280
00:16:49,140 --> 00:16:51,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yippee!
— Thank you for the meal!</font>

281
00:16:56,730 --> 00:16:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Behind you!</font>

282
00:16:58,150 --> 00:16:58,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune!</font>

283
00:17:01,820 --> 00:17:04,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Why is Shizune...?</font>

284
00:17:04,650 --> 00:17:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move away, Naruto!
That's a fake!</font>

285
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a delight to see you
after such a long time...</font>

286
00:17:11,490 --> 00:17:13,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka... Naruto!</font>

287
00:17:13,250 --> 00:17:15,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei, who's that guy?!</font>

288
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:18,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Mizuki, Naruto.</font>

289
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:22,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki?! But he seems very
different from before!</font>

290
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:25,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, I remember that failure who
in his Academy days</font>

291
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:28,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">couldn't even master
a decent Transformation Jutsu!</font>

292
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:30,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! He's pissing me off!</font>

293
00:17:31,250 --> 00:17:33,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How's that, Iruka?
You hardly recognize me, do you?</font>

294
00:17:34,130 --> 00:17:37,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's true that
there's no comparison with before...</font>

295
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to being confined in
that sordid and boring prison cell</font>

296
00:17:41,470 --> 00:17:43,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was able to concentrate
on my ascetic training.</font>

297
00:17:43,810 --> 00:17:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thank you, Iruka...</font>

298
00:17:46,230 --> 00:17:47,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did you realize it was me?</font>

299
00:17:48,690 --> 00:17:51,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we rescued you while
you pretended to be Shizune</font>

300
00:17:51,270 --> 00:17:53,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you said,
"My colleagues are pursuing Mizuki."</font>

301
00:17:54,490 --> 00:17:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only time a subordinate leaves the
team leader behind to pursue the enemy</font>

302
00:17:57,410 --> 00:17:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would be when the team leader had
either died or was near death...</font>

303
00:18:00,580 --> 00:18:02,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you had incurred only
slight injuries.</font>

304
00:18:03,790 --> 00:18:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A textbook answer.</font>

305
00:18:05,790 --> 00:18:07,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also you didn't say anything</font>

306
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:10,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when I suggested making
a detour from our route.</font>

307
00:18:11,420 --> 00:18:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If your subordinates were in pursuit</font>

308
00:18:13,170 --> 00:18:16,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it would be a safer strategy to watch
the enemy's movements from a plateau!</font>

309
00:18:17,340 --> 00:18:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharp as you are you used
the prisoner's garb as a decoy</font>

310
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not to gain time
but to lead us into this trap!</font>

311
00:18:27,270 --> 00:18:30,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow... Your power of analysis
is as good as always.</font>

312
00:18:30,350 --> 00:18:32,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Makes me remember the old days!</font>

313
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mizuki... Stop with the stupid act!</font>

314
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:40,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have no idea of
the hardships I've endured!</font>

315
00:18:40,570 --> 00:18:43,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fuujin! Raijin! Do it!</font>

316
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yippee!
— Yippee!</font>

317
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Come on!
— Stop it, Naruto!</font>

318
00:18:46,700 --> 00:18:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your opponent is me!</font>

319
00:18:51,130 --> 00:18:52,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get away, Naruto!</font>

320
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:55,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be fine, Iruka-sensei!</font>

321
00:18:57,800 --> 00:18:58,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto?!</font>

322
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you have the leeway
to look away do you?!</font>

323
00:19:01,010 --> 00:19:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Flee... Naruto!</font>

324
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

325
00:19:09,690 --> 00:19:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna lose!</font>

326
00:19:12,230 --> 00:19:14,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

327
00:19:19,110 --> 00:19:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

328
00:19:22,120 --> 00:19:24,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the same face here and over here too.</font>

329
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:28,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6...</font>

330
00:19:28,830 --> 00:19:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother, I don't have
enough fingers to count them all!</font>

331
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:34,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot, Raijin.
Use my hands too!</font>

332
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow! You're so smart, Fuujin...</font>

333
00:19:39,340 --> 00:19:41,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What the hell are
those guys about?!</font>

334
00:19:41,550 --> 00:19:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get in the way!</font>

335
00:19:42,930 --> 00:19:45,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have business with Mizuki!</font>

336
00:19:45,970 --> 00:19:48,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Elder Brother,
he said we were in the way.</font>

337
00:19:48,980 --> 00:19:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But take a look! Elder Brother!
Mizuki looks busy.</font>

338
00:19:55,730 --> 00:19:58,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's true. He looks busy.</font>

339
00:19:58,650 --> 00:20:00,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And also if we go back just like this</font>

340
00:20:00,900 --> 00:20:02,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we won't be able to eat
a sumptuous meal!</font>

341
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:06,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.
I forgot about the sumptuous meal!</font>

342
00:20:06,530 --> 00:20:09,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Sumptuous meal!
— Sumptuous meal!</font>

343
00:20:09,830 --> 00:20:12,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel a little thrown off balance.</font>

344
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:16,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's regroup everybody!</font>

345
00:20:16,630 --> 00:20:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

346
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm itchy, Elder Brother...</font>

347
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:34,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, itchy...</font>

348
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:48,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My punches aren't having
any effect whatsoever...</font>

349
00:21:17,900 --> 00:21:22,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">kusottare na nyuusu ga toori sugite</font></b></font></font></font>

350
00:21:17,900 --> 00:21:22,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">crappy news pass us by</font></b></font></font></font>

351
00:21:22,190 --> 00:21:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">kimi wa kotoba wo nakusu</font></b></font></font></font>

352
00:21:22,190 --> 00:21:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">and you become speechless</font></b></font></font></font>

353
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">boku no koe ja marude chiisa sugite</font></b></font></font></font>

354
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">my voice is way too soft</font></b></font></font></font>

355
00:21:31,580 --> 00:21:34,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">kimi wa henji mo shinai</font></b></font></font></font>

356
00:21:31,580 --> 00:21:34,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">so you don't answer</font></b></font></font></font>

357
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">kimi ga naiteru hitori de naiteru</font></b></font></font></font>

358
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">you're crying, crying alone</font></b></font></font></font>

359
00:21:40,580 --> 00:21:45,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">boku wa dou suru boku mo naiteru no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

360
00:21:40,580 --> 00:21:45,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">what can I do? I'm crying too</font></b></font></font></font>

361
00:21:45,670 --> 00:21:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">yoru ni hitoribocchi no ore no sakebi ni nosete</font></b></font></font></font>

362
00:21:45,670 --> 00:21:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">"let my lonely scream ring out through the night"</font></b></font></font></font>

363
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:57,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">zawameku jidai wo ore no supiido de buttobashiteku yeah yeah yeah yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

364
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:57,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">I'll thrash this confused era with my speed, yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

365
00:21:57,470 --> 00:22:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">sanzameku yoru mo ore no supiido de buttobashiteku yeah yeah yeah yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

366
00:21:57,470 --> 00:22:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">and I'll thrash this confused night with my speed, yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

367
00:22:06,900 --> 00:22:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">tsunzaku gitaa to ore no supiido de buttobashiteku yeah yeah yeah yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

368
00:22:06,900 --> 00:22:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">I'll thrash them with my piercing guitar and my speed, yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

369
00:22:16,360 --> 00:22:28,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">katamuku sekai mo warui yatsura mo kechirashiteku yeah yeah yeah yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

370
00:22:16,360 --> 00:22:28,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">I'll take this sinking world, all its evil bastards, and kick their butts, yeah</font></b></font></font></font>

371
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:42,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn! What are these two?!</font>

372
00:22:42,500 --> 00:22:43,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">They're not just big!</font>

373
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:48,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">They can't be beat with
just technique and Jutsu!</font>

374
00:22:49,050 --> 00:22:52,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Just when I need to get Mizuki!</font>

375
00:22:53,220 --> 00:22:56,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">In any case
I can't waste time with them!</font>

376
00:22:56,270 --> 00:22:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I have to circumvent them somehow
and beat 'em to the punch!</font>

377
00:23:00,600 --> 00:23:04,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"The New Three-Man Group! Two People and a Dog!"</font>

